laurel 2990: after a watchdog bark the panic hold resets by itself in 20 s, whatever laurelpanic says.

[V 2026-11-03 18:48:00, kernel c68eeb19c9] 2987 kept the bite armed: `on: bark: the phone resets in 30 s by the bite` printed, and at 90 s the phone was still in the hold, answering `pong (panic)`. So the bite does not reset here, cause [U]. The hold's own timed reset does not depend on it. Any other panic holds as before.

